  (text "E-paper pin table from the GDEY0213B74 datasheet, section 5 (pin 8 is BS1, tied low for 4-wire SPI; 6/7 TSCL/TSDA and 19 VPP unused, open)."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "7867baa2-55ad-c7c9-9bbe-5a004e9e140f"))
  (text "Booster as Good Display's reference: 47 uH, 30 V N-MOSFET, 2.2 ohm sense, MBR0530 diodes, 1 uF 50 V on the gate and source rails."
    (at 20 262 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "85860cbb-151e-3515-c5dd-21f1c5157973"))
  (text "Panel operating range is 0 to 50 C: firmware skips refreshes outside it (BMP390 temperature)."
    (at 20 267 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "1d04da9e-346e-0e57-1a96-3c0c5dd07efa"))
  (text "Buttons: five Alps SKRTLAE010 side-push switches on one long edge (UP, OK, DOWN, MARKER, PWR); the case carries the caps and the seal."
    (at 20 272 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "1d36699e-4853-2a97-d637-31c74cd16555"))
  (text "UP / OK / DOWN use the MCU's internal pull-ups; debounce in firmware."
    (at 20 277 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "c6c22852-1b74-1276-952b-a724c36cdc39"))
  (text "Marker input: 1k series, 10k pull-up, 100 nF (1 ms) against cable noise; EXTI15 on PA15, timestamped from TIM2."
    (at 20 282 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "124811d8-df06-dcd4-e895-b063a918c520"))
  (text "Expansion 3V3 goes through a 100 mA PTC so a shorted cable cannot pull down the logger."
    (at 20 287 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "45a643e7-b599-f2c4-e8c7-88bea21553dd")))
